; fb2dx on the FANUC macro corpus (../../fanuc_macros, from Peter Smid, "FANUC CNC Custom Macros"):
; NAME (expected/NAME.out), then the fb2dx inputs and options. A main program gets the programs it
; calls; a macro gets a test caller (kc*.nc, written for these tests, not from the book) where one
; makes sense; the rest run alone. smid.rsp holds the options the book assumes (FBCORPUS.md 5).
